{"id":"4e0f03a34c592870","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-qml-complexity.md","title":"Complexity of Quantified Provability Logic","display":"thm-qml-complexity — Complexity of Quantified Provability Logic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-qml-complexity","aliases":["89-thm-qml-complexity"],"display":"thm-qml-complexity — Complexity of Quantified Provability Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-qml-validity-sets]]","[[89-df-relative-completeness]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-qml-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-qml-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-qml-complexity — Complexity of Quantified Provability Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce269af4e544b5ee\" href=\"?note=ce269af4e544b5ee\" title=\"89-df-qml-validity-sets\">89-df-qml-validity-sets</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ced779f9ea9b74df\" href=\"?note=ced779f9ea9b74df\" title=\"89-df-relative-completeness\">89-df-relative-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>标准 PA 可靠，编码与有限实现取上述有效约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V=\\{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ \\mathbb N\\models B\\}\">\\(\\mathcal V=\\{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ \\mathbb N\\models B\\}\\)</span>，即全部算术真句子的码集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\mathrm{AT}_Q\">\\(\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\)</span> 取总可证、总为真码集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Complete}_m\">\\(\\mathsf{Complete}_m\\)</span> 为总可计算多一完备性。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qml\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\Pi^0_2)\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AT}_Q,\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qml\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\Pi^0_2)\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AT}_Q,\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 233–239；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n分别是 Vardanyan 的 Theorem 2 与 McGee–Vardanyan–Boolos 的 Theorem 3。上界：合法实现编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 可计算，PA 有证明可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists k\\,\\mathsf{Check}\">\\(\\exists k\\,\\mathsf{Check}\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\exists k\">\\(\\forall j\\exists k\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_2\">\\(\\Pi^0_2\\)</span>；对每个翻译是否真查询 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>，全称量化实现给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)\\)</span>。\n下界使用原书的有效编码归约：任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_2\">\\(\\Pi^0_2\\)</span> 集合的无穷见证问题编码为总可证句；任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 集合通过 oracle 计算编码为总为真句。完整归约的 Artemov 引理等在原书 pp.226–239；本条引用来源证明，未逐原子重写这些构造。\n第二个复杂度有真值 oracle，不能误记成无 oracle 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\)</span> 或“递归可枚举”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-qml-validity-sets","status":"resolved","id":"ce269af4e544b5ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-validity-sets]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-relative-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"ced779f9ea9b74df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-relative-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal V=\\{\\ulcorner B\\urcorner\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ \\mathbb N\\models B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\mathrm{AT}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Complete}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qml\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AP}_Q,\\Pi^0_2)\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AT}_Q,\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)).","display":true},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists k\\,\\mathsf{Check}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall j\\exists k","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1","display":false}],"bytes":1864,"backlinks":[{"id":"5195478e7a49fc18","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-qml-complexity]]"},{"id":